  characterName: Nehanda Mbizi
  promptText: "Little one, corporate GMO seeds blew into our fields. Burn the crop
    and we go hungry this year; keep it and our traditional seeds are at risk forever.
    \n\nWhat do I sacrifice?"
  leftAnswer: Burn it. Your seed stock feeds every future year
  rightAnswer: Keep it. Feed the people in front of you
